            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Penneech is a 17th-century British 2-player trick game. Trump changes each trick (turned from stock). The 7â™¦ (Peneech) is highest when diamonds are trump and scores 7. Ace/K/Q/J of trumps score 5/4/3/2. First to 61 wins.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: "Described in Charles Cotton's Compleat Gamester (1676). One of the earliest documented trick games.",
              },
            ],
          },
